# SvelteKit / Svelte 5

Runes are forced on app files in `@svelte.config.js` (`vitePlugin.dynamicCompileOptions` → `runes: true`). Match existing pages and components.

## Components and pages

- Use `<script lang="ts">`.
- Component/page props: `let { children } = $props();` or `let { data } = $props();` — see `@src/routes/+layout.svelte` and `@src/routes/product/[slug]/+page.svelte`.
- Local UI state: `$state`. Derived values: `$derived` or `$derived.by(() => { ... })`.
- Events: `onclick`, `onsubmit` (Svelte 5), not `on:click`.
- Each page sets `<svelte:head><title>… | Digital Atelier</title></svelte:head>` (home uses a marketing title).
- Shared chrome is `Nav` + `Footer` in the root layout only. Do not duplicate site nav/footer on individual routes.
- Icons: Material Symbols Outlined (`<span class="material-symbols-outlined">…</span>`), already loaded in `@src/app.html`.

## Routing and data

- Routes live under `src/routes/` (`+page.svelte`, `+page.ts`, `+layout.svelte`).
- Universal `load` functions: `export const load: PageLoad = …` with `import type { PageLoad } from './$types'`.
- Missing catalog/order: `error(404, '…')` from `@sveltejs/kit` (see `@src/routes/product/[slug]/+page.ts`).
- `/checkout` redirects to `/checkout/shipping` (`@src/routes/checkout/+page.ts`).
- Order confirmation is **client-only**: `export const ssr = false` in `@src/routes/orders/[id]/+page.ts` because orders live in `localStorage`.
- Read the current URL with `page` from `$app/state` (`const path = $derived(page.url.pathname)`), not `$app/stores`.
- Client navigation: `goto` from `$app/navigation`.

## Stores vs runes

- **Writable stores** (`svelte/store`) are for persisted commerce state: `@src/lib/stores/cart.ts`, `auth.ts`, `checkout.ts`, `orders.ts`. Subscribe in markup with `$cart`, `$auth`, etc.
- **Runes** are for component-local UI (qty, search, form drafts).
- Factory pattern: `createXStore()` returning `{ subscribe, …methods }`, then `export const cart = createCartStore();`.
- Guard `localStorage` with `browser` from `$app/environment`. Never touch `localStorage` during SSR.

## Types and modules

- Domain types live in `src/lib/types/` (`product.ts`, `order.ts`, `shipping.ts`).
- Use `import type { … }` for type-only imports.
- Prefer named exports. Keep helpers next to their data (`getProductById` / `formatPrice` in `@src/lib/data/products.ts`).
